# Text is normalised to LF in the repository and checked out as LF everywhere.
#
# This matters more than usual here: a manifest's specDigest is computed over the
# *canonical* form of a spec, and a checkout that rewrites line endings would leave the
# committed bytes and the parsed values quietly disagreeing on a contributor's machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary